Subject: [PATCH 1040/3799] soh: rename func_808A2008 -> BgMoriElevator_Move

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the riding action installed by BgMoriElevator_StopMovement: eases the platform to targetY at up to speed 12 and plays the stop sfx on arrival.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Mori_Elevator/z_bg_mori_elevator.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
